      "text": "[ PASSOFF- 132 ]"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "(The Person I Respect the Most)"
    },
    {
      "type": "hints",
      "text": "The person I respect the most is General Soon-Shin Lee."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "General Lee lived 500 years ago, and he defeated the Japanese over"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "and over again."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "He lived during a difficult time of Korean history,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "but he always thought of Korea and Koreans before himself."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "He created the turtle ship that he had used against the Japanese"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "and conquered them many times."
    },
